<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Quality Dining initiated.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Quality Dining initiated.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs said it initiated coverage of Quality Dining Inc as market outperform.</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 1-5/16 to 28-9/16.  </p>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs said it also initiated coverage of Signature Resorts with a market outperform rating.</p>
<p>-- shares fell 1/8 to 18.</p>
</text>
